  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We build on the interest of tea and other companies to conserve the South West Mau Forest for its microclimate services and of the Kenyan government to improve livelihoods of communities. Together we work towards a holistic landscape management as well as forest conservation, water, sustainable energy and community livelihoods.</narrative>
